# =============================================================================
# CommerSync — CODEOWNERS
# =============================================================================
# CURRENT STATE: Solo developer (@taruns0203) — every path routes to one owner.
#
# WHY THE SECTIONED STRUCTURE STILL EXISTS:
# Even as a solo dev, this file is written the way it would look once the repo
# has real teams. When CommerSync grows past one contributor, you swap
# @taruns0203 for the relevant team handle on each line — the sections,
# ordering, and rule precedence don't change. This avoids a rewrite later.
#
# GitHub evaluates rules TOP TO BOTTOM. For any given file, the LAST matching
# pattern wins (not the most specific — the last one written). Keep new rules
# BELOW any broader rule they need to override.
# =============================================================================

