# =============================================================================
# MIGRATION PATH — when you add a second contributor or a team
# =============================================================================
# Don't restructure. Just re-point individual lines:
#     /server/payments/  @taruns0203        →   /server/payments/  @security-team
#     /client/            @taruns0203        →   /client/            @frontend-team
# Global default (`*`) should be the LAST thing you repoint, once every
